    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge between abstract patterns and real-world logic for me—something I’ve always found both challenging and deeply rewarding. It’s not just numbers; it’s the language of structure, problem-solving, and understanding how things connect. Though my formal education was limited, I’ve built intuition through self-study and practical applications in fields like chemistry and photography, where precision matters.",
